Palm's Help (com.palm.app.help), as shipped on HP webOS 3.x, with webOS Archive's change of
its content host from help.palm.com to help.webosarchive.org.

Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open licence; distributed by
Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers: no owner has
asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.

The app is as it was packaged but for one change, codepoet's exception to rule 5 in
CLAUDE.md (2026-11-03), marked [Lunacy] in index.js: it chose its tablet UI only on a screen
exactly 1024 wide, the TouchPad's, so on any other tablet it showed its phone UI. It now also
takes the tablet UI wherever Lunacy says it is a TouchPad (a tablet; phone mode says Pre3).
Its articles come from webOS Archive's help host.
